  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Citizen Engagement in Urban Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to share information and tools on citizen engagement in urban development in the Netherlands with civil servants working on urban development in the countries mentioned above. The project thereby aims to support and inspire the participants to use citizen engagement, youth participation and good governance for spatial justice and climate resilient and sustainable and inclusive cities.</narrative>
  </description>
